  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "一张LEIFARNE 雷夫尼 转椅和LINNMON 利蒙/KRILLE 克瑞尔 带脚轮书桌，摆放在墙边，形成了一个工作区，四周为储物单元和艺术品。",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "s29301700"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/55/92/55925097a239af476abe46dd2608b673.jpg"
