    "pub-column",
    "在厨房里，一张用作工作区的NORRÅKER 诺鲁克 吧台，搭配DALFRED 达夫利 吧台凳和存放各种杂物配件的手推车。",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "40429014"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/bb/4b/bb4b934c1d6c644adc0695d8723f6e21.jpg",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/35/96/3596f08f715846ce1bb5d002e8c8baee.jpg"
